{{!
    @template local_ai_reportcreator/report_rows

    Table body rows for a rendered report or dashboard. The output replaces the
    ROWS placeholder in the stored, AI-generated template_html. Every cell value
    is auto-escaped by the Mustache engine.

    Classes required for JS: none.
    Data attributes required for JS: none.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * rows - list of row objects
    * rows[].cells - list of string cell values, in column order

    Example context (json):
    {
        "rows": [
            { "cells": ["Alice", "42"] },
            { "cells": ["Bob", "7"] }
        ]
    }
}}
{{#rows}}<tr>{{#cells}}<td>{{.}}</td>{{/cells}}</tr>
{{/rows}}
